            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A swollen fallopian tube was found in a 34 years old woman operated for acute abdominal pain. During this operation the fallopian tube together with the appendix were removed. The histological examination identified appendicitis and a lipoma of the fallopian tube.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
